  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the creative realm of Alfonso Higareda's tattoo studio, a California haven where bespoke inking takes center stage. Specializing in striking black & gray, vibrant new school, and the bold, collage-inspired trashpolka style, Alfonso's mastery transforms skin into a canvas that tells a unique story. With the studio's doors open by appointment only, each piece is a carefully crafted, personal expression of art. Follow @harte_ponxo to witness the artistic journey that awaits at Alfonso's exclusive sanctuary of tattoo artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nAlfonso Higareda\nCalifornian artist \nOwner/ artist \nFine Artist/ painter",
